# r1107cco boot 10: SQ-CCO-08 again on the `full` srv (cco1, gravityLimitDimensions back to true), after b2/b3 found no
# low-gravity modifier on a falling zombie or survival bot in the End even with the limit off. Create Gravity resolves
# the biome config through a cache (cache_time 3 s): sample standing mobs after 6 s and 12 s, as r1107cc's SQ-CC-15
# (End villager gravity 0.016) presumably did.
pace 2

## SQ-CCO-08c | Create Gravity in the End only, sampled after the biome cache settles
> execute in minecraft:the_end run forceload add 0 0
> execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload add 0 0
> kill @e[tag=cco08]
> execute in minecraft:the_end run summon minecraft:villager 0 70 0 {NoAI:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["cco08","cco08e"]}
> execute in minecraft:overworld run summon minecraft:villager 3 200 3 {NoAI:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["cco08","cco08o"]}
> execute in minecraft:the_end run summon minecraft:zombie 0 150 0 {Silent:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["cco08","cco08z"]}
sleep 6
> execute in minecraft:the_end run attribute @e[tag=cco08e,limit=1] forge:entity_gravity get
> attribute @e[tag=cco08o,limit=1] forge:entity_gravity get
> execute in minecraft:the_end run attribute @e[tag=cco08z,limit=1] forge:entity_gravity get
sleep 6
> execute in minecraft:the_end run attribute @e[tag=cco08e,limit=1] forge:entity_gravity get
> attribute @e[tag=cco08o,limit=1] forge:entity_gravity get
> kill @e[tag=cco08]
look End villager value below 0.08 (0.016 with the default -0.8 factor), overworld villager 0.08

## SQ-CCO-14 | old potion id with Brewing absent: left untouched, no crash (emulated: no save from before the carve)
# The chest NBT is written the way an 11-06 save holds it (as r1107cc SQ-CC-09); this `full` set has no Brewing.
> setblock 6 71 6 minecraft:chest{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:potion",Count:1b,tag:{Potion:"creativecommon:long_reach"}}]}
sleep 2
> data get block 6 71 6 Items
expect creativecommon:long_reach
> save-all
sleep 3
> data get block 6 71 6 Items
expect creativecommon:long_reach
reject (?i)exception|crash
> setblock 6 71 6 minecraft:air
look the stack keeps Potion "creativecommon:long_reach" after a save (no rewrite to creativebrewing:, no crash); with Brewing installed the read is SQ-CC-09
